(7488553, 1192274, 124815, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of creatures like that floating around. Must be a contemporary taste. <br/>You''d probably enjoy a lot the works of a Russian team <a href="//aesf.art/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">AES+F collective</a>. Saw their Inverso Mundi at the Venice Biennale<br/> <br/>As a side note, the violets are too crude and even, the whole image too sharpened and the two elements too close in size. My opinion only, hope you don;t mind it. <br/>A lot of work here.</td>', 'There are a lot of creatures like that floating around. Must be a contemporary taste. You''d probably enjoy a lot the works of a Russian team AES+F collective. Saw their Inverso Mundi at the Venice Biennale As a side note, the violets are too crude and even, the whole image too sharpened and the two elements too close in size. My opinion only, hope you don;t mind it. A lot of work here.', '2016-12-23 16:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
